{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他不想再等到心里全明白，便先承担起自己能做的那部分。\",\n      \"key\": \"承担那部分\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"text\": \"结果没把握，他不再反复追问值不值得，心里仍有疑虑也肯尽力，行动让他有力气，也有些骄傲。\",\n      \"key\": \"有些骄傲\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-6\",\n      \"text\": \"他愿意再多给些，尽力本身就让他痛快，心里的不满也总算有地方使，一时顾不上问自己是否软弱。\",\n      \"key\": \"尽力本身\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\", \"B4\", \"B5\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他仍惦记着从前珍惜的东西，如今只能记在心里，不能像过去那样自然拥有。\",\n      \"key\": \"只能记在心里\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-4\",\n      \"text\": \"一察觉失落，他就急着把心思拉回眼前，反复告诉自己撑得住，因为他实在放不下。\",\n      \"key\": \"反复告诉自己\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他不甘心就这样垮下去，一再把自己撑起来，可想到放不下的事，劲头又泄了，焦急得安顿不下来。\",\n      \"key\": \"不甘心垮下去\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\", \"B5\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R5\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留不等彻底想清、先承担自己能做部分的转变，把行动原则改成具体选择，并接回S01-4对自己迟迟不肯行动的难堪。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R6\", \"R7\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"合并结果未定、心有疑虑仍肯尽力，以及行动带来的力量和骄傲。保留从反复计算值不值得到愿意尽力的变化，去掉重复的主体性总结。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R8\", \"R9\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-6\"],\n      \"what\": \"恢复并合并\",\n      \"why\": \"找回尽力本身带来的主动快乐、愿意给得更多、倾尽力气的痛快，以及暂时顾不上反复审视自己的状态。用一时限定这种投入感，不把它写成已经消除了疑虑和软弱，也不抹掉后面的焦急与自我劝说。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R10\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-3\", \"S02-4\", \"S02-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"具体化并展开\",\n      \"why\": \"把抽象的‘一小块心’改成他仍惦记、却不能像从前那样拥有的珍惜之物。再写出这份失落怎样使他急着劝自己撑住，以及为什么即使反复撑起自己，仍会焦急、泄劲。保留行动没有照顾到的牵挂，并补足B1、B3、B4、B5各自的心理原因。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d3e43349-f83c-4314-bd4c-7fcad73fc30c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T002237025089Z", "elapsed_seconds": 200.219, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T00:25:57.252175+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8b613401f262170ef05743e8d5b4842fd3427a0b0447edc44bf85caf62a85dca", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc